{
  "name": "Substack Newsletter & Trending Posts Watch -> Google Sheets & Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-substack-daily",
      "name": "Daily 08:00 Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/yannabadie~substack-api-mcp/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{$env.APIFY_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"mode\": \"posts\",\n  \"publications\": [\n    \"https://www.lennysnewsletter.com\",\n    \"https://newsletter.pragmaticengineer.com\"\n  ],\n  \"sortBy\": \"new\",\n  \"includeFullBody\": false,\n  \"onlyFreePosts\": false,\n  \"maxResults\": 20\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-substack-call",
      "name": "Fetch Substack Posts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "valid-post-id",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.postId}}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-valid-posts",
      "name": "Keep Valid Substack Posts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "engagement-total",
              "name": "engagementTotal",
              "value": "={{Number($json.likesCount || 0) + Number($json.commentsCount || 0) + Number($json.restacksCount || 0)}}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true
      },
      "id": "set-substack-metrics",
      "name": "Compute Engagement Score",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        920,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Substack_Intel",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "recordKey": "={{$json.recordKey}}",
            "postId": "={{$json.postId}}",
            "publicationName": "={{$json.publicationName}}",
            "title": "={{$json.title}}",
            "authorName": "={{$json.authorName}}",
            "postDate": "={{$json.postDate}}",
            "isPaywalled": "={{$json.isPaywalled}}",
            "likesCount": "={{$json.likesCount}}",
            "commentsCount": "={{$json.commentsCount}}",
            "restacksCount": "={{$json.restacksCount}}",
            "engagementTotal": "={{$json.engagementTotal}}",
            "url": "={{$json.url}}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "recordKey"
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sheets-substack-upsert",
      "name": "Upsert Posts into Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1180,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{$env.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL}}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"text\": \"Substack Post [{{$json.publicationName}}]: *{{$json.title}}*\\nBy {{$json.authorName || 'Author'}} | Likes: {{$json.likesCount || 0}} | Comments: {{$json.commentsCount || 0}} | Restacks: {{$json.restacksCount || 0}}\\nLink: {{$json.url}}\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "slack-substack-alert",
      "name": "Post Trending Substack to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1180,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Substack Newsletter Intelligence Watch\n1. Set n8n env vars `APIFY_TOKEN` and `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL` (zero hardcoded credentials).\n2. Customize `publications` (supports custom domains, subdomains, `@handles`, or switch `mode` to `leaderboard` for Rising/Top Paid rankings).\n3. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` and run once manually to test.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-substack-setup",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Clean Engagement Tracking\n- **Keep Valid Substack Posts** filters non-post records.\n- **Compute Engagement Score** sums likes + comments + restacks.\n- **Upsert Posts into Google Sheets** matches on `recordKey` so daily runs update metrics cleanly.",
        "height": 175,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-substack-output",
      "name": "Scoring & Deduplication Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        40
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily 08:00 Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch Substack Posts",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch Substack Posts": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Keep Valid Substack Posts",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Keep Valid Substack Posts": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Compute Engagement Score",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Compute Engagement Score": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upsert Posts into Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Post Trending Substack to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "instanceId": "yannabadie-substack-intel-template-v1"
  }
}
